  "title": {
   "en": "HOT HEADS"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Follow the Main character \"Mero\" in his journey for freedom. Being betrayed in the gang he used to work for. He was sold into employment by a man who looks scarily similar to him. Seeing him work his way up the company ladder, meeting friends and foes with his team. Following his adventures of self realization, and connecting with the people closest to him. While taken down the scum of the world. With a paycheck."
